    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "THINK - First sentence in your head: “不要一个词一个词翻译，把前后2-4个词当一整块。”",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1930
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "WHY - Why this works: 完形常考真实用法，如 take responsibility, pay attention to, come to a",
