      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "1 把空与前后词连成短语。",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1934
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "2 回忆是否见过固定搭配。",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1935
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "3 若不确定，用语义和介词搭配排除。",
      "sourcePage": 69,
      "sourceIndex": 1936
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "text": "4 记错题时记整个语块，不只记答案单词。",
